  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), Premium left-hand SCG (GF_MKIV_SCG-L-P_1200_03) on the Gunfighter base, seen from the rear left, front of the stick to the left: grip face, B1 on the outer (left) side, rapid-fire lever and red trigger at the front, edge of the C1 thumb hat on the right",
  "mappingSource": "catalog vkb.json: inputs copied from the right-hand SCG Premium factory numbering, EDCD community map 231D0126 (https://github.com/EDCD/EliteCustomButtonNames/blob/main/files/INTO%20Bindings/DeviceButtonMaps/231D0126.buttonMap), assumed identical for the left hand (catalog note, medium); control names and locations from VKB's binding template \"VKB Gunfighter SCG (LH)\" v1.0 by UntoldForce, linked on https://vkbsimcontrollers.com/pages/downloads (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-Gunfighter-SCG-LH-v1.0.pdf): A4 top-left hat, A1 ministick (textured cap top right), A3 centre hat, A2 red, B1 side button, C1 thumb hat, rapid fire trigger, main trigger, D1 pinky - labels only, no numbers",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "note": "The model's main photo and gallery-2/3/4 (SCG-L_1200_*) show the STANDARD left grip (no rapid-fire lever); the Premium photos are gallery-5/6/7 (SCG-L-P_1200_01/03/05). gallery-6 shows the most controls. Push/Pull Brake (BTN26/27) = the template's push/pull 'Rapid Fire Trigger' (black lever in front of the red main trigger), as for the right-hand twin. The LH grip is the mirror of the RH: the template's photo is a rear-right view, so face positions were transferred left-right unchanged (both are seen from behind).",
